{"server":"cn","storyId":"act15d0_level_act15d0_07_end","groupId":"act15d0","stageId":"act15d0_07","title":"背叛","storyCode":"MB-7","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"d4c6ed5e2793c592b2d6e9ddadc9567e5510cbcea1c048f395abb50f59e02526","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，见鬼了，钥匙卡到底哪里去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是上厕所的时候被我冲掉了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"巴顿老大，怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"少管闲事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，神气什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"或许......又是谁触了他的霉头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，我猜是安东尼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道是怎么回事，好像有人要对他下手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"巴顿不是天天吹我们监狱多么好多么完善，这下他肯定难受死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也是狱警。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我不是高兴有人刺杀，我就是看到他不爽就挺爽的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"而且说白了，咱们这些年，看伦道尔和巴顿做的龌龊事还少吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"要我说啊，伦道尔绝对知道这些刺客哪儿来的，他就是收了钱懒得管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"......或许吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_commandroom"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"咕......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"别动，罗宾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"不要逼我杀你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，真没想到，我居然没发现罗宾你是内奸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定你有干这行的天赋呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你手里拿的是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"那是炸药的开关？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"卡夫卡，快去启动塔下沉的机关！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇！烧起来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"我都要忘了是哪个了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"而且这些感觉都不能用了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我找到了，应该是这个按钮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"拜托了，千万要能用啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"我按！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么感觉没怎么动，难道真的是坏了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"罗宾，为什么你要这么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"动了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"*哥伦比亚俚语*"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，上次去顶楼都不知道是什么时候了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"下次跟伦道尔大哥说一声补一张好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"巴顿老大，你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"您要干嘛？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"我上去看看那些渣滓打扫得怎么样！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狱警A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"怎......怎么了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴顿","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"什么东西，怎么回事？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"抓紧身边的东西，卡夫卡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"安东尼，那边，罗宾要被甩进电梯里去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"抓紧我了，罗宾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"现在不是说话的时候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"咬紧牙根，别咬到舌头！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"安东尼，你和罗宾没事吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事，罗宾在我怀里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"看来整个监狱的电力系统都瘫痪了，这里一片漆黑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"这对我们来说算是一个机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚才感觉塔直接往下硬穿了一层。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"我们现在应该在地下二层左右，距离医务室还有些距离呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，趁狱警们还没反应过来，走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"罗宾，你没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我没事真的是好事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以不必这么在意这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟我早就说过，“你依然可以尝试刺杀我”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"而如果你认为你做的事情是一种背叛，那我可以告诉你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我们之间的关系恐怕也没有好到可以讨论信赖关系的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"诶，我也不算吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"不算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"诶，安东尼你好无情哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕对刚认识几个月的人就完全信任才是有问题的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我确实会有些失望，但也仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"但我依然好奇，你和我们相处的时间中表现出的那些情感并不是演戏，这我能够看得出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"是什么促使你做出这样的选择，罗宾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我的父亲，他能赚很多钱，也对我很好，是我引以为豪的父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"但是有一天，他的公司忽然倒闭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之后，他再也没有成功过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"于是他变了，他开始酗酒，开始变得易怒，开始痛恨身边的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"母亲因此离开了他，他也背了许多债，最后，他因为肝脏问题和许多我根本看不懂的并发症住进了医院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"母亲一直也劝我跟她一起生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"但我始终记得父亲过去对我的好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要为他做些什么，所以我放弃了许多过去的爱好，尝试做了许多工作，但父亲的医药费实在是太贵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"直到有一天，有一个人找上我说，他可以给我许多钱，只要我帮他杀一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"那个人就是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，我无法许诺你任何东西，所以你做了这个选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他其实就在监狱里假扮成狱警观察着你，他叫杰斯顿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"你邀请我后，他找到我，告诉我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"是西蒙家族最后的反扑让我父亲的公司覆灭的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......居然有这样的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的话，恐怕我非但不应该责怪你，还应该向你道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你不要道歉，我不是想说这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"不是这样的，安东尼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我其实也觉得这样是错的，这样是不好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我放弃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道不这样做我该怎么做，我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我好累啊，母亲要我做出选择，父亲要我做出选择，生活要我做出选择，杰斯顿要我做出选择，你也要我做出选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想做选择，我不想判断每一件事是对是错，是好是坏，我不想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我好累啊，为什么啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你不能把选择权交给别人，罗宾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你必须自己去思考每一件事，去做出每一个选择，并为每一个选择负责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"否则的话，你是无法主宰自己的命运的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我在这座监狱的几年生活中学到的最重要的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"力量很重要，智慧也很重要，但最重要的，是勇气，是为自己的选择买单的勇气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我也会恐惧自己出错，但我不能就此逃避选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经以为我无人可以依靠是因为没有找到依靠的对象，但后来我发现，这样的对象并不存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只能依靠自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我为我没有及时发现你的痛苦而感到抱歉，罗宾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我也再次向你强调，你做的事确实险些破坏了我的越狱计划，因此我不会轻易说我原谅你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"但是站在一个曾经同样经历过与你类似痛苦的人的立场上，我希望你可以暂时忘记这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你必须重新审视自己，去思考，你究竟想要做什么事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"我究竟......想要做什么事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"前面就是杜玛的房间了，你可以慢慢想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"......虽然你可能不相信我的话，但是，杰斯顿已经从我这里知道了你们全部的越狱计划，他一定在哪里等着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，不用担心找不到我，我就在这里等着你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗宾","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"是杜玛的房间里传来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安东尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_214_kafka","aliases":["卡夫卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","aliases":["安东尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_451_robin","aliases":["罗宾"]}]}
